    "All four write keys (finance.invoice.issue, finance.adjustment.record, finance.payment.apply, finance.refund.record) are already registered in EOS (migration 1761609600000) with exactly the Firebase holders, except partsManager.",
    "partsManager: a Firebase holder of finance.invoice.issue and finance.adjustment.record that the Owner-ruled R3 delta REVOKES in EOS (DECISIONS #193, purchasingFinanceClosureDelta.ts). The committed baseline still lists the original migration grant; whether Administration has applied the revoke is a nonprod read. Parity with Firebase is NOT recommended for partsManager.",
