    "No new key is required for Firebase parity. A new key is required only if the Owner answers OD-F1-1 / OD-F1-4 with an approval step (an approver key) or OD-F1-9 with a void key; those are not Firebase parity and are listed in the spec for Owner decision, not proposed as grants."
